          "question": {
            "text": "A container of fixed volume has a mixture of one mole of hydrogen and one mole of helium in equilibrium at temperature <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> . Assuming the gases are ideal, the correct statement(s) is (are)",
            "image": null
