              "text": "The ratio of the rms speed of helium atoms to that of hydrogen molecules is  <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
