          "question": {
            "text": "Statement I The total translational kinetic energy of all the molecules of a given mass of an ideal gas is $1.5$ times the product of its pressure and its volume.\nStatement II The molecules of a gas collide with each other and the velocities of the molecules change due to the collision.",
